  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 3.38,
      "end": 5.76,
      "en": "Hello everyone, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 6.5,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.84,
      "end": 7.38,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 8.12,
      "end": 15.22,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you again our romantic, dramatic, suspense series, I'm Sorry I Love You Part 7.",
      "zh": "今天我们再次为您带来我们的浪漫、戏剧、悬疑系列，对不起，我爱你第 7 部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 15.82,
      "end": 20.08,
      "en": "So we're gonna find out what's happening with Steven and Veronica.",
      "zh": "所以我们将了解史蒂文和维罗妮卡发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.08,
      "end": 24.76,
      "en": "Right, in the last episode, Veronica was at the doctor's, she was pregnant.",
      "zh": "对，在最后一集中，维罗妮卡在医生那里，她怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 25.23,
      "end": 29.13,
      "en": "But then the doctor told her it was a lie and he made it up and she wasn't even pregnant.",
      "zh": "但随后医生告诉她这是一个谎言，他编造了，她甚至没有怀孕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 29.51,
      "end": 29.77,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 30.76,
      "end": 33.96,
      "en": "So now let's see what Veronica and Steven are gonna say to each other.",
      "zh": "所以现在让我们看看维罗妮卡和史蒂文会对彼此说什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 33.96,
      "end": 34.63,
      "en": "Maybe they will break up?",
      "zh": "也许他们会分手？"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 34.96,
      "end": 35.15,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 35.96,
      "end": 36.96,
      "en": "I don't think so.",
      "zh": "我不这么认为。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 47.44,
      "en": "But let's listen.",
      "zh": "但让我们听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 47.44,
      "end": 48.81,
      "en": "Thank God you showed up when you did.",
      "zh": "谢天谢地，你来得正是时候。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 49.68,
      "end": 49.87,
      "en": "He's insane.",
      "zh": "他疯了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 51.13,
      "end": 52.29,
      "en": "Do you think we should call the police?",
      "zh": "你认为我们应该报警吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 53.07,
      "end": 53.99,
      "en": "Don't worry about it.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 54.51,
      "end": 56.35,
      "en": "I'll call my friend and have him take care of it.",
      "zh": "我会找个朋友处理这事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 56.81,
      "end": 58.59,
      "en": "I can't believe he was stalking you all these years.",
      "zh": "真没想到他这些年一直在跟踪你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 58.88,
      "end": 59.88,
      "en": "What a nutjob.",
      "zh": "真是个疯子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 59.88,
      "end": 60.31,
      "en": "I know.",
      "zh": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 61.01,
      "end": 62.85,
      "en": "Well, he said I'm not pregnant.",
      "zh": "好吧，他说我没有怀孕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 63.41,
      "end": 65.69,
      "en": "I'm sorry if I got you all worked up over nothing.",
      "zh": "对不起，让你为一场乌龙紧张成这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 66.55,
      "end": 68.97,
      "en": "I want you to know that I didn't do it on purpose.",
      "zh": "你要知道，我不是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 69.31,
      "end": 69.79,
      "en": "Don't apologize.",
      "zh": "不用道歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 70.83,
      "end": 74.87,
      "en": "From the moment I met you, not a day has gone by when I haven't thought of you.",
      "zh": "自从认识你，我一天都没停止想你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 75.53,
      "end": 77.25,
      "en": "And now that I'm with you again, I'm just...",
      "zh": "现在我又和你在一起了，我只是..."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 77.92,
      "end": 79.34,
      "en": "I'm just scared, Veronica.",
      "zh": "我只是害怕，维罗妮卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 79.78,
      "end": 81.48,
      "en": "The closer I get to you, the worse it gets.",
      "zh": "我越靠近你，就越害怕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 82.48,
      "end": 86.58,
      "en": "The thought of not being with you, I mean, I just can't handle it.",
      "zh": "我一想到可能失去你，就受不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 86.92,
      "end": 88.38,
      "en": "We were made for each other, Veronica.",
      "zh": "维罗妮卡，我们是天生一对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 89.39,
      "end": 90.25,
      "en": "You're my everything.",
      "zh": "你是我的一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 91.25,
      "end": 91.85,
      "en": "My soulmate.",
      "zh": "我的灵魂伴侣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 92.35,
      "end": 93.51,
      "en": "What can I do?",
      "zh": "我能怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 93.99,
      "end": 94.87,
      "en": "Just hold me.",
      "zh": "抱紧我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 95.51,
      "end": 97.59,
      "en": "I'll always be here for you, no matter what.",
      "zh": "无论如何，我都会一直在你身边。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 98.33,
      "end": 101.95,
      "en": "And together, we can tackle whatever life throws at us.",
      "zh": "不管生活带来什么难题，我们都能一起面对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 102.53,
      "end": 103.79,
      "en": "I believe in us, Steven.",
      "zh": "我相信我们，史蒂文。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 106.18,
      "en": "I'm so happy to hear that.",
      "zh": "我很高兴听到这个消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 106.66,
      "end": 107.96,
      "en": "I know we belong together.",
      "zh": "我知道我们注定在一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 108.08,
      "end": 109.08,
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": "我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 109.09,
      "end": 109.87,
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": "我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 129.8,
      "end": 132.06,
      "en": "It was such a romantic moment.",
      "zh": "这是一个如此浪漫的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 132.52,
      "end": 133.14,
      "en": "And now what happened?",
      "zh": "现在发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 133.52,
      "end": 133.88,
      "en": "Somebody got shot.",
      "zh": "有人被枪杀了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 134.52,
      "end": 135.52,
      "en": "Oh my God.",
      "zh": "我的天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 135.52,
      "end": 136.52,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 136.52,
      "end": 137.52,
      "en": "This is like so big.",
      "zh": "这太大了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 137.52,
      "end": 138.22,
      "en": "I can't believe this is happening.",
      "zh": "我不敢相信这会发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 139.12,
      "end": 148.38,
      "en": "Well, it's a very intense drama, but we saw some great words and a lot of great phrases in there when Steven was telling her all these beautiful words, right?",
      "zh": "嗯，这是一部非常激烈的戏剧，但当史蒂文告诉她所有这些美丽的词时，我们在那里看到了一些很棒的词和很多很棒的短语，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 148.72,
      "end": 148.96,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 149.14,
      "end": 152.46,
      "en": "So why don't we look at some of these words now in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "那么，我们现在为什么不在语言外卖中看一些这些词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 155.08,
      "end": 156.08,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 158.18,
      "end": 162.88,
      "en": "Veronica was glad or she was very happy that Steven showed up.",
      "zh": "维罗妮卡很高兴，或者她很高兴史蒂文出现了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 163.36,
      "end": 163.8,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 164.2,
      "end": 164.98,
      "en": "Showed up.",
      "zh": "出现了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 165.46,
      "end": 166.4,
      "en": "So, to show up.",
      "zh": "所以，要出现。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 166.68,
      "end": 167.68,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 167.68,
      "end": 167.96,
      "en": "To come to a place.",
      "zh": "来一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 168.68,
      "end": 169.68,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 169.68,
      "end": 170.68,
      "en": "Or to arrive.",
      "zh": "或到达。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 170.68,
      "end": 171.68,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 171.68,
      "end": 176.64,
      "en": "So let's listen to some examples of how we can use show up in different contexts.",
      "zh": "所以让我们听听一些例子，说明我们如何在不同的上下文中使用 show Up。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 176.64,
      "end": 176.92,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 179.72,
      "end": 182.23,
      "en": "We were waiting for you like an hour and you never showed up.",
      "zh": "我们在等你一个小时，你从来没有出现过。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 186.0,
      "end": 186.23,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 189.32,
      "end": 190.4,
      "en": "I didn't invite him to the party.",
      "zh": "我没有邀请他参加聚会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 190.88,
      "end": 196.32,
      "en": "He just simply showed up uninvited.",
      "zh": "他只是不请自来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 196.32,
      "end": 200.04,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 200.04,
      "end": 203.74,
      "en": "After months of being lost, my dog finally showed up with a family.",
      "zh": "经过几个月的迷路后，我的狗终于和家人一起出现了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 204.8,
      "end": 207.04,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 207.04,
      "end": 209.42,
      "en": "So I think it's pretty clear now the verb show up.",
      "zh": "所以我认为现在动词显示很清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 209.92,
      "end": 212.82,
      "en": "And I think this verb is a little bit informal, isn't it?",
      "zh": "我认为这个动词有点非正式，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 213.08,
      "end": 214.08,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 214.08,
      "end": 215.94,
      "en": "You wouldn't really tell your boss, hey, I'm waiting for you to show up.",
      "zh": "你不会真的告诉你的老板，嘿，我在等你出现。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 216.28,
